# Forget a memory

If the user named a memory id, call the `Forget` tool with it directly.

Otherwise search first with `SearchMemories`, show the user the candidate facts,
and only call `Forget` on the ones they confirm.

Repository, circle and workspace memories are shared with teammates. Never
forget one without the user saying explicitly that the shared fact should go.
Personal memories are theirs alone and need no extra confirmation beyond the
request.
